& [Request]
  + bind source canonical signature custody predecessor implementation bookend proof branch remote proposal principal role subject and exact unresolved-authority list
  + unresolved order is policy_governance key_custody revocation_truth current_time live_decision fresh_observation private_execution_permit broker_projection physical_preparation
  + maximum attempts is one retry zero cleanup zero fixture_only true and request digest is self-excluding domain-separated
  + no private key signature live decision timestamp observation permit projection or preparation receipt is a request field

& [Roles]
  + exact order is operator_principal policy_governor key_custodian revocation_authority time_witness observation_acquirer permit_issuer broker_executor
  + each role has one exact responsibility statement and cannot satisfy another role
  + compiler and verifier are not ceremony roles

& [Stages]
  + C1 preserve and approve policy governance source
  + C2 bind supplied public verifying-key custody
  + C3 bind and observe revocation truth
  + C4 acquire trusted current-time witness
  + C5 accept externally produced authorize or reject decision
  + C6 replay published cryptographic correspondence verification
  + C7 acquire fresh expected-current host and workspace observation
  + C8 form and independently admit private execution permit
  + C9 form and independently admit production-broker projection
  + exact predecessor edges are C1 none C2 C1 C3 C2 C4 C3 C5 C4 C6 C5 C7 C6 C8 C7 C9 C8
  + each stage binds one role exact input and output descriptor arrays authority_before authority_required authority_after unresolved_after and one effect account
  + compiler describes but does not execute any stage

& [AuthorityConservation]
  + provider-free request plan and verification start with all nine unresolved authorities and end with all nine unresolved
  + C6 may describe cryptographic_correspondence_only as a predecessor fact but cannot promote any ceremony authority
  + status is operator_authority_ceremony_plan_verified_awaiting_separately_supplied_governance_and_live_decision
  + authority is ceremony_plan_only fixture_only true
  + policy_governance_proved current_nonexpired live_authorization_admitted fresh_observation_proved private_execution_permit_present production_broker_projection_present physical_preparation_authorized are false

& [EffectAccount]
  + key generation private-key read signing decision issuance clock read environment read host observation process provider model MCP network writer Git filesystem runtime publication persistence activation cleanup D-drive WSL remote FPGA Minecraft and foreign effects are false or zero
  + maximum attempts one retry zero cleanup zero
  + any nonzero effect or mutable authority refuses

& [StrictForms]
  + canonical compact UTF-8 JSON denies unknown and duplicate properties
  + maximum form bytes 1048576 depth 24 fields 512 roles 8 stages 9 authorities 9 artifact descriptors 64 and text bytes 8192
  + identifiers are nonnil lowercase UUIDs where required and digests are lowercase sixty-four hex
  + arrays requiring order are exact and all identities are duplicate-free
  + self-digests are domain-separated self-excluding SHA256

& [IndependentVerification]
  + compiler accepts one bounded request path and one bounded output path or stdout as later locked
  + verifier accepts exact retained evidence directory and writes nothing except canonical verification stdout
  + evidence membership is exact regular nonlink bounded same-parent files with manifest bytes and SHA256
  + independent verifier recompiles twice and compares request plan and verification bytes
  + adversaries redigest semantic mutations for lineage stage role edge authority fixture attempt retry cleanup effect and receipt laundering

& [ImplementationBoundary]
  + after valid satisfaction signature safe Rust may implement request plan verification evidence modules two bounded CLIs one integration test one focused script fixtures and documentation
  + production may parse validate hash serialize compile and independently verify only
  + no signer signing key clock environment process network Git filesystem writer provider model MCP broker observation permit or physical-execution surface
  + no new package source provider download remote fallback WSL D-drive runtime FPGA Minecraft cleanup or foreign work

